This repository redistributes a converted form of Depth Anything 3 Metric-Large.

Depth Anything 3
  Upstream code:    https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/Depth-Anything-3
  Upstream weights: https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/DA3METRIC-LARGE
  Copyright the Depth Anything 3 authors (ByteDance Seed).
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes made for HDRI Studio:
  - Exported to ONNX (opset 17) at a fixed 336 x 252 portrait input with PyTorch.
  - The network's final mono sky step (replacing sky depth by the 99th percentile of the other depths) is switched
    off in the export; the HDRI Studio server applies the same step after inference.
  - No weights were changed.

HDRI Studio does not claim ownership of the Depth Anything 3 architecture or weights.
